                <p>There is disclosed a composition comprising an aqueous solution containing at least one polymerase, wherein the at least one polymerase includes a reverse transcriptase present in the aqueous solution at a concentration of from about 0.1 U/µl to about 0.6 U/µl, a trehalose bulking agent, a detergent, an organic buffer, at least one oligonucleotide useful for performing a molecular assay, deoxynucleotide triphosphates (dNTPs), and less than 0.1 mM magnesium ions.</p>
